{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OnSlaught</strong>\u00a0puts you in the pilot seat of a never ending nightmare - where an entire alien civilization wants you dead. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll face diverse enemies, each demanding a unique weapon and strategy to defeat, similar to classic boomer shooters like DOOM.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE MONSTROUS ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level presents new challenges and opportunities for you. Slingshot around black holes, destroy flesh abominations, and outmaneuver colossal lasers as you progress deeper into the darkness of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/Eye.gif?t=1740084928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENGAGE AND DESTROY:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master all nine of your weapons and use your grappling hook to hurl objects at armies of ships as you battle your way to salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/GaussGif.gif?t=1740084928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ONE MAN VERSUS GOD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a being forged from pain and suffering, standing against an unstoppable Goliath. Your expedition will bring inhuman amounts of agony. Will you rise and defeat the trials of death, or crawl back to the dungeon from where you once came?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1698820/extras/FallGif.gif?t=1740084928\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1698820?t=1740084928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamsta